WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.690
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.960 --> 00:02.230
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

3
00:02.250 --> 00:03.500
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

4
00:03.520 --> 00:04.770
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

5
00:04.790 --> 00:06.040
viewer discretion is advised]

6
00:06.500 --> 00:08.620
Someone like myself does not avoid others,

7
00:08.800 --> 00:11.700
but I cannot share a bed with someone who is intoxicated,

8
00:11.920 --> 00:15.360
nor can I bind my life to someone of different morals.

9
00:15.690 --> 00:18.590
The chief knew about the clues and kept them from me, Sarge.

10
00:18.610 --> 00:20.550
He doesn't want me to investigate the case.

11
00:20.880 --> 00:22.300
For someone like me,

12
00:22.320 --> 00:24.240
should I wish to have anyone enamored of me,

13
00:24.880 --> 00:26.480
my beauty alone

14
00:26.800 --> 00:27.720
would suffice...

15
00:28.040 --> 00:29.800
Wear this upon you.

16
00:30.210 --> 00:32.000
Do not give it to anyone so readily again.

17
00:32.310 --> 00:34.800
May the sacred beings watch over you

18
00:35.610 --> 00:37.760
until your good intentions

19
00:37.780 --> 00:40.080
prevail.

20
00:52.820 --> 00:53.680
What's this?

21
01:03.370 --> 01:05.850
Fabled iron, invulnerable, a mighty rampart.

22
01:06.220 --> 01:09.720
Pure copper, a sacred amulet, crafted with the master's spell and arts.

23
01:09.820 --> 01:12.760
Lustrous gold, burning like the sun, with power untold.

24
01:13.080 --> 01:15.840
Untainted silver, breaking curses beneath the moon's hold.

25
01:16.240 --> 01:18.760
Blue bornite, guarding against harm, imbued with might.

26
01:18.960 --> 01:21.920
Wild mercury, reflecting poison and sorcery's blight.

27
01:22.280 --> 01:25.080
Zinc of yore, interlaced with all else, their powers unveiled.

28
01:25.500 --> 01:28.920
Forged into a weapon, piercing every yantra without fail.

29
01:30.260 --> 01:31.840
Here, I beseech the Buddha's virtues.

30
01:32.280 --> 01:35.400
Here, I beseech the Buddhist Masters, the Supreme Masters.

31
01:35.960 --> 01:37.580
Buddham prasiddhi,

32
01:37.600 --> 01:39.040
Dhammam prasiddhi,

33
01:39.360 --> 01:40.800
through all of Na, Ma, Pa, Ta,

34
01:41.040 --> 01:43.040
whatever incantation dwells within,

35
01:43.400 --> 01:44.640
may it be ravaged,

36
01:44.880 --> 01:46.360
may it be blighted

37
01:46.500 --> 01:48.640
by the power of Namo Buddhaya.

38
01:59.760 --> 02:00.720
Do use them

39
02:00.920 --> 02:03.600
to uphold justice, as is your duty.

40
02:05.400 --> 02:07.920
Stay here, my beautiful daughter.

41
02:08.240 --> 02:10.080
Do not leave them.

42
02:11.920 --> 02:13.080
One day...

43
02:13.710 --> 02:15.030
they will come to you.

44
02:16.700 --> 02:18.020
When that time comes,

45
02:19.120 --> 02:22.240
only your compassion can aid them.

46
02:38.530 --> 02:42.930
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

47
02:42.950 --> 02:47.600
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

48
02:47.620 --> 02:51.930
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

49
02:51.950 --> 02:56.250
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

50
02:56.270 --> 03:00.680
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

51
03:00.700 --> 03:05.200
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

52
03:05.220 --> 03:09.310
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

53
03:09.330 --> 03:13.880
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

54
03:13.900 --> 03:18.530
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

55
03:45.700 --> 03:47.890
Peem, how are you?

56
03:48.500 --> 03:50.180
I'm fine, Mom.

57
03:51.480 --> 03:52.320
Mom,

58
03:53.670 --> 03:55.350
how is Phu doing?

59
03:57.680 --> 03:59.650
The doctor says he's the same.

60
03:59.670 --> 04:01.480
Physically, he looks normal.

61
04:01.500 --> 04:02.780
He's alright now.

62
04:02.840 --> 04:05.560
All that's left now is for him to wake up on his own.

63
04:08.270 --> 04:09.490
Peem,

64
04:10.910 --> 04:13.790
can you promise me just this once, to ease my mind,

65
04:15.000 --> 04:17.270
that you won't get involved with that case again?

66
04:21.090 --> 04:22.980
Don't worry about me, Mom.

67
04:23.780 --> 04:25.140
I'm here...

68
04:26.720 --> 04:28.340
I'm going to be okay.

69
04:29.980 --> 04:30.980
Liar!

70
04:38.220 --> 04:39.300
Just now,

71
04:39.980 --> 04:41.280
what were you saying?

72
04:42.770 --> 04:44.470
I said great.

73
04:44.490 --> 04:47.370
It gives me peace of mind knowing you're safe over there.

74
04:47.890 --> 04:49.280
What's wrong, Peem?

75
04:52.480 --> 04:53.440
Right...

76
04:54.740 --> 04:56.020
Nothing, Mom.

77
04:56.270 --> 04:58.970
I was probably just hearing things.

78
05:00.860 --> 05:01.700
Well...

79
05:02.060 --> 05:03.840
I'll get back to work now.

80
05:03.860 --> 05:05.740
I'll call you later.

81
05:08.270 --> 05:09.960
Take good care of yourself.

82
05:09.980 --> 05:13.390
I'll call the chief regularly to check on you, okay, Peem?

83
05:14.820 --> 05:15.700
Alright, Mom.

84
05:27.430 --> 05:28.870
[Mae Sot Provincial Police Station]

85
05:28.890 --> 05:30.030
Alright, here he comes.

86
05:31.290 --> 05:32.610
- Hello. - Hello.

87
05:32.730 --> 05:33.590
Hello.

88
05:34.280 --> 05:35.320
Uh, this is...

89
05:35.710 --> 05:36.630
Inspector Chon,

90
05:36.980 --> 05:38.340
stationed at Mae Sot Police Station.

91
05:38.830 --> 05:39.870
He's Chai's nephew,

92
05:40.090 --> 05:41.790
the guy we saw at the municipal market.

93
05:42.890 --> 05:43.890
I remember.

94
05:44.590 --> 05:45.510
This is Lieutenant Peem.

95
05:45.890 --> 05:46.890
She was transferred from Bangkok

96
05:47.280 --> 05:48.990
just to work on this case.

97
05:49.770 --> 05:50.750
Nice to meet you.

98
05:51.590 --> 05:53.110
Nice to meet you.

99
05:53.790 --> 05:55.970
I think we should get straight to the point.

100
05:55.990 --> 05:57.590
I have somewhere to be after this.

101
05:58.890 --> 06:00.480
What? Didn't you take a day off today?

102
06:04.890 --> 06:06.710
Alright, let's take this conversation over there.

103
06:06.730 --> 06:07.390
Alright.

104
06:09.790 --> 06:10.630
Lieutenant,

105
06:11.580 --> 06:13.350
here's the file you're looking for.

106
06:15.100 --> 06:17.220
From the clues I've gathered in secret,

107
06:17.680 --> 06:19.400
Krating and his guys

108
06:19.570 --> 06:22.590
are moving along the Thailand-Myanmar border.

109
06:23.590 --> 06:25.110
But even now,

110
06:25.170 --> 06:27.830
we still can't pinpoint the exact location of their hideout.

111
06:28.430 --> 06:29.530
That's why I forwarded the information

112
06:29.550 --> 06:31.310
to the other provincial police stations

113
06:31.510 --> 06:32.990
so they can be on a lookout.

114
06:33.840 --> 06:35.170
So that means...

115
06:35.190 --> 06:36.230
Krating

116
06:36.550 --> 06:39.670
is somewhere in Tak, right?

117
06:40.030 --> 06:42.030
That's likely the case.

118
06:42.590 --> 06:44.870
The thing is, we don't know exactly where he is.

119
06:45.750 --> 06:46.830
But don't worry.

120
06:47.110 --> 06:49.190
I'm in the process of requesting that my superiors

121
06:49.210 --> 06:51.510
put me in charge of this case.

122
06:51.870 --> 06:54.550
If there's any progress, I'll reach out to you.

123
06:55.410 --> 06:56.930
Please do, Inspector.

124
06:56.950 --> 07:00.110
Nevertheless, I want to catch him with my own hands.

125
07:00.690 --> 07:01.370
Yes.

126
07:02.750 --> 07:04.610
I've contacted the police checkpoints

127
07:04.630 --> 07:06.190
to obtain additional information.

128
07:06.310 --> 07:08.170
That way, we can identify the car

129
07:08.190 --> 07:10.910
he uses to escape, including its appearance and license plate.

130
07:12.530 --> 07:14.710
Please let us know when you have more clues.

131
07:15.270 --> 07:16.830
Of course, I'll reach out.

132
07:16.850 --> 07:18.190
- Yes, sir. - Thank you.

133
07:19.630 --> 07:20.890
Anyway, please excuse me.

134
07:20.910 --> 07:22.450
I have another case to take care of.

135
07:22.470 --> 07:23.650
- Yes, sir. - Oh, right.

136
07:23.670 --> 07:24.250
Alright.

137
07:24.270 --> 07:25.310
- Excuse me. - Alright.

138
07:28.850 --> 07:30.470
- Goodbye. - Thank you.

139
07:36.070 --> 07:37.270
3:30 P.M.

140
07:37.390 --> 07:39.970
What you need is not something that may be done with ease.

141
07:40.300 --> 07:42.000
Perils will come your way

142
07:42.130 --> 07:43.910
from the very instant you seek the sacred materials.

143
07:45.070 --> 07:47.070
What are you trying to say, Master?

144
07:47.600 --> 07:49.100
Please tell me.

145
07:50.580 --> 07:52.460
As you gather the sacred materials,

146
07:53.390 --> 07:55.550
the Buddha's virtues shall spread far and wide.

147
07:56.110 --> 07:58.720
Restless spirits and ghosts shall storm in

148
07:58.810 --> 08:00.110
as if a great merit-making ceremony were underway.

149
08:01.470 --> 08:03.270
Whatever eyes and ears you boast,

150
08:03.410 --> 08:05.190
your foes boast the same.

151
08:06.010 --> 08:08.010
I want you to be very careful, my dearest.

152
08:11.030 --> 08:13.300
These lethal weapons thirst for blood.

153
08:13.630 --> 08:15.510
Were they placed in the hands of an evil soul,

154
08:16.150 --> 08:17.770
innocent blood

155
08:17.790 --> 08:19.270
would be sacrificed.

156
08:21.430 --> 08:22.670
I promise that

157
08:23.460 --> 08:25.460
only evil blood

158
08:25.990 --> 08:28.550
will be sacrificed to the weapons you create.

159
08:29.400 --> 08:30.670
Above all else,

160
08:30.990 --> 08:31.990
you must seek

161
08:32.350 --> 08:33.570
every material

162
08:33.590 --> 08:35.230
before sunset.

163
08:36.450 --> 08:37.870
Sunset...

164
08:38.710 --> 08:40.470
There's a deadline for this?

165
08:40.790 --> 08:41.790
So what if

166
08:42.070 --> 08:43.370
I couldn't find them all?

167
08:43.390 --> 08:44.430
Cease your search.

168
08:44.490 --> 08:46.310
Cherish your life.

169
08:46.990 --> 08:49.670
Think not that this is the only night to perform the ritual.

170
08:50.230 --> 08:52.950
We shall even linger for another full moon.

171
08:54.010 --> 08:54.850
It'd be too late.

172
08:55.230 --> 08:57.490
I can't wait that long.

173
08:58.030 --> 08:59.950
If any clues come up,

174
09:00.190 --> 09:01.990
I have to capture him immediately.

175
09:03.750 --> 09:05.030
Rules are rules.

176
09:05.490 --> 09:07.890
Nighttime belongs to ghosts.

177
09:07.910 --> 09:10.260
It is not suitable for any endeavor,

178
09:10.280 --> 09:12.310
unless it be an inauspicious one.

179
09:15.490 --> 09:17.950
Fulfill your task with every ounce of mindfulness and wit.

180
09:19.060 --> 09:20.710
Wrath and vengeance

181
09:20.730 --> 09:22.430
shall only blind you.

182
09:24.310 --> 09:27.070
Wear this necklace at all times until every material is sought.

183
09:27.790 --> 09:29.790
They shall shield you from all harm.

184
09:35.880 --> 09:37.080
What is that?

185
09:41.950 --> 09:42.990
Buying lottery tickets?

186
09:45.690 --> 09:48.160
If I want to find everything on this list,

187
09:48.180 --> 09:50.350
where's the nearest place I can get them?

188
09:50.550 --> 09:53.130
I have some gold on me.

189
09:53.150 --> 09:56.250
I just need everything else on the list.

190
09:56.270 --> 09:57.530
Can you recommend a place?

191
09:57.550 --> 09:59.430
I need to get there before sunset.

192
09:59.580 --> 10:00.640
From here,

193
10:00.770 --> 10:01.750
the nearest place would be

194
10:02.070 --> 10:03.250
Rim Moei Market [Rim Moei Market]

195
10:03.270 --> 10:04.070
in Mae Sot.

196
10:04.270 --> 10:05.710
It's ten minutes from here.

197
10:06.350 --> 10:07.790
Come on, let's get moving, Sarge.

198
10:08.630 --> 10:10.870
This is the Rim Moei Market I told you about.

199
10:12.910 --> 10:15.010
So, the stall I'm looking for is right here?

200
10:15.030 --> 10:15.950
Exactly.

201
10:16.740 --> 10:17.660
Here's the stall.

202
10:25.910 --> 10:26.630
Excuse me.

203
10:27.950 --> 10:29.230
Do you have what I'm looking for?

204
10:34.300 --> 10:35.020
Whoa...

205
10:36.730 --> 10:38.590
Where did you folks get this list?

206
10:39.270 --> 10:40.630
Who gave this to you?

207
10:41.690 --> 10:43.210
It doesn't matter who.

208
10:43.630 --> 10:44.950
Do you have them, Shaman?

209
10:45.670 --> 10:46.430
I do,

210
10:47.430 --> 10:48.350
but I cannot give them to you.

211
10:50.000 --> 10:51.350
These items choose their owners.

212
10:52.190 --> 10:53.910
I cannot just give them out randomly.

213
10:54.910 --> 10:55.750
You...

214
10:56.090 --> 10:57.590
do not possess enough virtue for it.

215
10:58.710 --> 11:00.070
Your shadow might yet lose its head.

216
11:00.170 --> 11:02.110
You could've just said it nicely. Why curse me?!

217
11:04.670 --> 11:05.890
Let's go somewhere else, Sarge.

218
11:05.910 --> 11:06.830
- Let's! - Wait!

219
11:16.150 --> 11:17.070
What?!

220
11:17.670 --> 11:18.710
Hold on...

221
11:41.120 --> 11:43.460
"Blue bornite, guarding against harm, imbued with might."

222
11:43.490 --> 11:45.450
[Blue bornite]

223
11:46.430 --> 11:47.030
Whoa...

224
11:49.110 --> 11:51.270
Today, deadly misfortune awaits you.

225
11:53.960 --> 11:54.840
You're drunk, right?

226
11:55.590 --> 11:56.770
Look at that face. Let's go, Lieutenant.

227
11:56.790 --> 11:57.350
Right.

228
11:58.430 --> 11:59.150
- Whoa! - Whoa!

229
12:04.990 --> 12:05.710
Sarge...

230
12:05.950 --> 12:06.710
- Blood! - Yes?

231
12:11.950 --> 12:12.950
Lieutenant! I got slashed!

232
12:13.510 --> 12:14.160
I got slashed!

233
12:14.270 --> 12:15.270
Shaman!

234
12:17.830 --> 12:18.790
Shaman!

235
12:18.810 --> 12:20.230
Shaman, help me!

236
12:20.870 --> 12:21.750
I fucking got slashed!

237
12:29.350 --> 12:31.250
Mom, will Dad be alright?

238
12:31.270 --> 12:33.790
How would I know? What did you do, Priew?

239
12:38.630 --> 12:39.150
Goodness!

240
12:39.790 --> 12:40.330
Dad!

241
12:40.350 --> 12:41.890
- Dad, Dad! - Ow, that hurts, that hurts.

242
12:41.910 --> 12:43.370
Ow, ow, ow, that hurts, that hurts!

243
12:43.390 --> 12:44.510
Let go. You're hurting me.

244
12:44.530 --> 12:46.010
Ow! That hurts, that hurts.

245
12:46.030 --> 12:48.190
- You're hurting me, you're hurting me. - Jeez, you're gonna hurt your dad!

246
12:48.210 --> 12:49.800
- Ow, ow, ow. - Dad, are you okay?

247
12:49.840 --> 12:52.310
"Fulfill your task with every ounce of mindfulness and wit."

248
12:53.350 --> 12:55.070
"Wrath and vengeance

249
12:55.100 --> 12:56.920
shall only blind you."

250
13:20.520 --> 13:21.360
Take a seat.

251
13:32.760 --> 13:34.770
How many pieces have you gathered so far?

252
13:42.780 --> 13:45.700
Counting the gold I already have on hand,

253
13:45.910 --> 13:47.570
this would be the third piece.

254
13:48.030 --> 13:49.410
Your clock is ticking

255
13:50.130 --> 13:51.090
from the instant you started.

256
13:51.720 --> 13:52.820
Make haste.

257
13:53.460 --> 13:54.820
Eventide

258
13:55.320 --> 13:57.020
is not a good sign.

259
13:58.580 --> 13:59.940
You must give me your word

260
14:00.740 --> 14:01.940
that whatever is given to you

261
14:02.360 --> 14:04.260
will be used only against evil wights.

262
14:09.100 --> 14:09.780
Yes,

263
14:10.030 --> 14:10.970
I give you my word.

264
14:11.820 --> 14:14.140
I will use it only to take down the bad guys.

265
14:14.660 --> 14:16.510
Just do not go back on your word.

266
14:17.520 --> 14:19.700
Should you break it,

267
14:19.720 --> 14:21.340
it will ricochet back upon you

268
14:21.730 --> 14:23.220
a hundredfold, a thousandfold.

269
14:41.980 --> 14:45.620
"Pure copper, a sacred amulet, crafted with the master's spell and arts."

270
14:47.110 --> 14:48.470
What you are looking for.

271
14:50.500 --> 14:52.140
Mortal bodies are impermanent.

272
14:53.580 --> 14:55.900
Even with a prized and sacred object upon you,

273
14:56.170 --> 14:58.420
it too will deteriorate with age.

274
14:59.120 --> 15:00.220
Hurry along.

275
15:00.350 --> 15:02.120
You do not have much time left.

276
15:03.520 --> 15:04.340
Right.

277
15:07.040 --> 15:07.980
Thank you.

278
15:20.730 --> 15:21.890
Whoa, ma'am.

279
15:22.690 --> 15:23.530
How did you get here?

280
15:23.840 --> 15:24.900
This place is already closed.

281
15:36.900 --> 15:38.420
[Kengkla Buakhao, beloved father]

282
15:38.440 --> 15:40.180
[Date of Birth: January 12, 1958 Date of Death: August 22, 2020]

283
15:40.200 --> 15:41.840
[Sirichai379: Construction materials, plumbing and electrical supplies,

284
15:41.860 --> 15:43.500
construction hardware, hand tools, and gardening tools]

285
15:45.100 --> 15:46.060
Whoa, hey!

286
15:46.530 --> 15:47.740
Just make sure it's nice and tight.

287
15:48.320 --> 15:50.600
If you drive off and they fall onto someone,

288
15:51.180 --> 15:52.660
we'll all be screwed.

289
15:52.940 --> 15:53.820
If it's gonna fall,

290
15:53.980 --> 15:56.440
it's either on your head or mine, man,

291
15:56.460 --> 15:58.180
not anyone else's.

292
15:58.500 --> 15:59.700
Jeez,

293
16:00.700 --> 16:02.940
you've really learned to talk back.

294
16:03.100 --> 16:05.040
- Come on, man. - How about I backhand you?

295
16:08.940 --> 16:09.900
Hey, Seua.

296
16:10.820 --> 16:12.600
Who's that lady walking towards us?

297
16:13.920 --> 16:15.140
She's gorgeous, man.

298
16:16.290 --> 16:18.220
Hello, beautiful.

299
16:18.370 --> 16:19.460
I'm Seua.

300
16:19.980 --> 16:21.420
Anything I can help you with?

301
16:21.590 --> 16:22.900
I'm looking to buy some metal.

302
16:22.920 --> 16:24.620
Well, what kind do you need?

303
16:25.010 --> 16:26.570
Angle bars, steel bars,

304
16:26.700 --> 16:27.740
or round bars?

305
16:27.800 --> 16:29.460
You can tell me anything.

306
16:29.860 --> 16:32.080
I'll get you whatever you need, beautiful.

307
16:32.100 --> 16:33.380
I'm the owner here.

308
16:33.400 --> 16:34.900
We have all kinds of metal.

309
16:35.980 --> 16:36.940
Fabled iron,

310
16:37.500 --> 16:38.580
do you sell that?

311
16:38.900 --> 16:39.980
- Fabled iron. - Fabled iron.

312
16:41.260 --> 16:42.020
Oud,

313
16:42.460 --> 16:44.040
get her the fabled iron from the back.

314
16:44.060 --> 16:45.480
Get her a really shiny one.

315
16:45.500 --> 16:46.460
Sure thing, man.

316
16:46.640 --> 16:47.620
- Are you crazy? - What?!

317
16:47.780 --> 16:49.660
- Jeez. - What fabled iron? We don't have that.

318
16:49.800 --> 16:50.780
Beautiful,

319
16:51.130 --> 16:52.550
we only sell steel bars here.

320
16:53.180 --> 16:54.500
If you want fabled iron,

321
16:54.520 --> 16:55.860
you'll have to go into the woods.

322
16:56.700 --> 16:58.020
But if you really wanna go there,

323
16:58.620 --> 16:59.940
I'll take you.

324
17:00.200 --> 17:01.460
We've gotta go pretty deep, though.

325
17:01.900 --> 17:03.240
Be careful,

326
17:04.040 --> 17:06.580
or Seua the Tiger could maul you. Nom!

327
17:07.420 --> 17:09.020
Oops, just an ordinary tiger, that is.

328
17:09.350 --> 17:10.620
Still interested?

329
17:10.860 --> 17:11.940
So you don't sell them?

330
17:13.340 --> 17:14.420
How could I?

331
17:14.720 --> 17:15.740
I've only ever seen steel bars.

332
17:16.040 --> 17:17.140
Seua! Oud!

333
17:17.920 --> 17:19.360
You two bastards.

334
17:19.820 --> 17:21.820
Why are you talking to a customer like that?

335
17:22.020 --> 17:23.420
Jeez, Dad.

336
17:23.620 --> 17:25.380
This beautiful girl wants fabled iron.

337
17:25.540 --> 17:26.940
We only have steel bars.

338
17:27.580 --> 17:29.500
I just offered to take her there, that's all.

339
17:30.320 --> 17:31.460
Fabled iron?

340
17:31.820 --> 17:32.700
Yes.

341
17:40.420 --> 17:41.830
Follow me inside.

342
17:57.480 --> 17:58.600
Hold out your hand.

343
18:02.660 --> 18:04.300
Jeez, Dad.

344
18:04.620 --> 18:06.200
Tryna get handsy with a lady?

345
18:06.220 --> 18:07.100
Seua!

346
18:07.300 --> 18:09.300
Go back to work at once.

347
18:09.540 --> 18:11.740
I know, Dad. You didn't have to chase me away.

348
18:12.500 --> 18:13.780
Beautiful,

349
18:13.910 --> 18:15.530
gonna deliver some stuff for a sec.

350
18:16.020 --> 18:17.340
Don't miss me just yet.

351
18:21.500 --> 18:22.620
I'll be right back.

352
18:25.740 --> 18:28.380
I have no ill intentions like my son does.

353
18:29.060 --> 18:30.380
Do not be afraid.

354
18:31.580 --> 18:32.900
Hold out your hand.

355
18:34.620 --> 18:35.700
Sit down!

356
18:36.420 --> 18:38.280
Dare you come,

357
18:38.860 --> 18:40.780
think not of fear.

358
19:32.940 --> 19:33.660
Uncle.

359
19:34.360 --> 19:35.780
Uncle, Uncle. Whoa...

360
19:36.740 --> 19:38.700
Let's go, Uncle. Get up slowly.

361
19:41.060 --> 19:42.920
Hey, get a move on

362
19:42.940 --> 19:44.340
so we can deliver these to the customer.

363
19:45.140 --> 19:46.580
You bet, Seua.

364
19:46.820 --> 19:48.300
All you do is talk, man.

365
19:49.080 --> 19:50.540
I'm just heading out.

366
19:58.060 --> 19:59.140
What the hell are you still doing?

367
19:59.560 --> 20:00.960
Something's wrong with the truck.

368
20:00.980 --> 20:02.340
The gear stick wouldn't budge.

369
20:03.060 --> 20:04.220
Give it another try.

370
20:05.330 --> 20:06.340
It won't budge, man.

371
20:07.020 --> 20:08.420
Get out, then. I'll handle it.

372
20:13.940 --> 20:14.900
What the hell?

373
20:17.420 --> 20:19.500
Fucking bastard! Why did you lock the door?

374
20:20.780 --> 20:22.920
I didn't. It locked itself, man.

375
20:22.940 --> 20:24.700
Bullshit. The door is fucking locked!

376
20:37.900 --> 20:38.700
Seua!

377
20:38.900 --> 20:40.380
Take your dad to the doctor!

378
20:40.940 --> 20:41.980
Who's calling you, man?

379
20:42.260 --> 20:43.380
Can you walk?

380
21:13.240 --> 21:15.620
"Fabled iron, invulnerable, a mighty rampart."

381
21:39.260 --> 21:40.460
You must seek

382
21:40.660 --> 21:43.500
every material before sunset.

383
22:07.840 --> 22:10.160
[Sirichai379 - Steel Merchant Wat Pa Lan Romyen]

384
23:18.230 --> 23:20.370
He is typically hard to come across,

385
23:20.540 --> 23:23.220
as he favors a life in the wild.

386
23:24.330 --> 23:27.900
It is fortunate that, on occasion,

387
23:28.910 --> 23:31.500
you can still meet the huntsman here.

388
23:31.820 --> 23:33.740
It is better than making your way

389
23:34.160 --> 23:36.380
to Mon Kru Ba.

390
23:43.940 --> 23:47.700
This is a reward for your endeavor.

391
23:48.460 --> 23:50.340
The ancient Sangkhawanon nail,

392
23:51.220 --> 23:54.210
pulled from the roof of an old ordination hall,

393
23:55.130 --> 23:56.530
serves as

394
23:57.320 --> 23:58.340
an alloy element.

395
24:13.880 --> 24:17.330
"Zinc of yore, interlaced with all else, their powers unveiled."

396
24:19.870 --> 24:23.380
Relinquish it to her, Loh-Se.

397
24:37.740 --> 24:39.060
What do you still need?

398
24:45.650 --> 24:46.530
I'm still missing...

399
24:46.830 --> 24:48.980
wild mercury and untainted silver.

400
24:49.740 --> 24:50.820
I don't have untainted silver,

401
24:51.740 --> 24:53.180
just wild mercury.

402
25:11.860 --> 25:13.140
Thank you.

403
25:13.740 --> 25:16.620
"Wild mercury, reflecting poison and sorcery's blight."

404
25:17.180 --> 25:18.380
If you have time,

405
25:19.780 --> 25:21.980
I can take you into the woods to find untainted silver.

406
25:30.520 --> 25:33.340
I only have until sunset today.

407
25:34.020 --> 25:35.580
I gave someone my word.

408
25:36.810 --> 25:38.290
Then, I'm sorry

409
25:39.110 --> 25:40.750
I can't follow through.

410
25:43.700 --> 25:45.930
Though you've already done more than enough.

411
25:46.700 --> 25:48.140
Gathering

412
25:49.740 --> 25:51.340
these materials

413
25:51.360 --> 25:52.900
is no easy feat.

414
25:54.260 --> 25:56.740
Even masters of sacred arts

415
25:57.940 --> 26:00.140
can take anywhere from a month to a year.

416
26:07.800 --> 26:10.000
Do not hold that thought.

417
26:12.020 --> 26:14.140
Had they not placed their faith in you,

418
26:14.800 --> 26:17.480
you would have never made it here

419
26:18.540 --> 26:23.980
to see Loh-Se and me.

420
26:26.820 --> 26:31.240
It is now up to you.

421
26:31.800 --> 26:33.140
If you are determined

422
26:33.420 --> 26:34.980
to fulfill it,

423
26:35.620 --> 26:36.820
fate...

424
26:37.340 --> 26:41.220
will guide you to fulfill what you have set

425
26:41.500 --> 26:42.420
your heart on.

426
27:00.440 --> 27:01.740
Thank you.

427
27:10.000 --> 27:10.900
May you be blessed and protected.

428
27:11.700 --> 27:12.900
Thank you.

429
27:27.380 --> 27:28.460
What are you doing?

430
27:29.640 --> 27:31.120
The water is perfectly cold.

431
27:31.140 --> 27:32.900
It will ease your soreness.

432
27:38.580 --> 27:40.100
Soak your feet in it.

433
27:44.540 --> 27:45.740
Thank you.

434
27:59.860 --> 28:01.420
Are you well, my dearest?

435
28:04.770 --> 28:05.730
It's nothing.

436
28:09.220 --> 28:11.460
I'm just mad at myself for...

437
28:12.400 --> 28:14.820
not being able to gather all the materials.

438
28:16.860 --> 28:18.100
I'm sorry.

439
28:19.980 --> 28:21.740
There are, in fact,

440
28:21.940 --> 28:24.620
many people in this vicinity who possess auspicious objects.

441
28:25.500 --> 28:26.860
Perhaps you merely...

442
28:27.250 --> 28:28.910
have not asked all of them.

443
28:39.380 --> 28:40.600
This is for you.

444
28:51.940 --> 28:55.260
"Untainted silver, breaking curses beneath the moon's hold."

445
28:59.580 --> 29:00.540
Really?

446
29:02.540 --> 29:03.660
Thank you.

447
29:04.480 --> 29:05.780
Thank you, truly.

448
29:07.580 --> 29:10.060
Next time, should you injure yourself again,

449
29:11.180 --> 29:12.940
I shall make it worse.

450
29:15.880 --> 29:17.740
Copy that.

451
29:30.980 --> 29:34.420
"Lustrous gold, burning like the sun, with power untold."

452
29:36.420 --> 29:37.460
Hold on.

453
29:39.820 --> 29:41.420
Cleave to the gold.

454
29:42.930 --> 29:44.730
It is no good to take it off your neck.

455
29:45.900 --> 29:47.580
I own plenty of gold.

456
29:48.500 --> 29:50.180
I shall endow it to you.

457
29:54.930 --> 29:56.690
You have endured much today.

458
29:57.220 --> 29:58.860
Let me take care of you.

459
30:07.490 --> 30:08.590
Are you holding up well?

460
30:18.380 --> 30:19.620
You are adorable.

461
30:27.710 --> 30:29.470
Thank you, once again.

462
31:26.930 --> 31:28.610
Master In's sanctum.

463
31:30.630 --> 31:31.850
My father.

464
32:22.850 --> 32:23.690
My dearest,

465
32:23.950 --> 32:25.190
pray you come to me.

466
32:34.870 --> 32:36.230
Master In...

467
32:38.660 --> 32:39.900
My father.

468
32:46.030 --> 32:47.790
Dignified

469
32:49.500 --> 32:51.040
and formidable.

470
32:54.740 --> 32:56.380
Just like his daughter.

471
33:11.130 --> 33:12.610
So, this place...

472
33:13.310 --> 33:14.780
Does no one really live here?

473
33:15.330 --> 33:16.540
Why...

474
33:16.960 --> 33:19.100
is there no dust

475
33:19.760 --> 33:21.040
or...

476
33:22.620 --> 33:23.900
cobwebs?

477
33:25.930 --> 33:27.770
Ever since he passed,

478
33:28.280 --> 33:29.920
no one has lingered here,

479
33:31.470 --> 33:32.830
save for me

480
33:32.850 --> 33:34.690
and his disciples,

481
33:34.710 --> 33:36.740
who take turns visiting and paying their respects.

482
33:38.300 --> 33:40.230
As for my mother, she dwells at the temple.

483
33:43.480 --> 33:45.160
Your mother...

484
33:48.780 --> 33:50.180
already passed?

485
33:52.220 --> 33:54.950
I suppose you would think so.

486
33:55.860 --> 33:57.860
My mother has kept the precepts

487
33:58.140 --> 34:01.140
and been ordained as a Buddhist nun ever since Master passed.

488
34:02.500 --> 34:04.760
Though only a few souls are acquainted with her.

489
34:08.020 --> 34:09.920
She was beauteous,

490
34:10.960 --> 34:12.340
and Master was protective of her,

491
34:12.940 --> 34:14.300
so he never let her go anywhere.

492
34:16.040 --> 34:16.860
Apart from me,

493
34:17.220 --> 34:20.080
Mother often pays this place a visit.

494
34:29.670 --> 34:31.890
Judging by her daughter,

495
34:33.240 --> 34:35.460
it goes without saying that...

496
34:37.820 --> 34:40.100
your mother must be very beautiful.

497
35:05.300 --> 35:07.540
I was also wondering

498
35:08.120 --> 35:11.180
why you wanted me to look for the materials from...

499
35:11.910 --> 35:13.150
these people.

500
35:31.570 --> 35:32.490
Is that

501
35:32.960 --> 35:34.380
the bullet forge?

502
35:48.600 --> 35:51.720
Did your father use this place...

503
35:51.740 --> 35:53.180
to make the consecrated bullets?

504
35:56.200 --> 35:57.580
In his time,

505
35:57.600 --> 36:00.230
the land abounded with bandits and wicked thieves.

506
36:00.820 --> 36:03.420
Spells and incantations alone would not suffice.

507
36:03.920 --> 36:05.820
They too had to be masters of weapons.

508
36:11.780 --> 36:13.460
If this world

509
36:13.740 --> 36:16.200
were full of criminals who knew such arts,

510
36:16.920 --> 36:19.640
police officers like me, with no knowledge of spells,

511
36:20.140 --> 36:23.420
would never be able to bring them to justice.

512
36:27.820 --> 36:29.060
When it comes to science,

513
36:29.560 --> 36:31.780
there are molecules invisible to the eyes.

514
36:33.110 --> 36:34.150
Oceans

515
36:34.350 --> 36:36.530
are too sublime to ever be discovered.

516
36:37.580 --> 36:38.940
You must truly believe

517
36:39.540 --> 36:43.220
that things that transcend far beyond mundane limits are true.

518
36:45.380 --> 36:47.360
Faith, too, has no shape or form.

519
36:48.140 --> 36:50.740
How could you know if something were wicked,

520
36:53.180 --> 36:55.300
should there not be morals to begin with?

521
36:57.220 --> 36:59.980
The entirety of this earth

522
37:00.260 --> 37:01.560
was created

523
37:01.580 --> 37:03.740
with the belief that all things shall be possible.

524
37:04.820 --> 37:07.220
You must merely have faith and believe;

525
37:07.770 --> 37:08.880
otherwise,

526
37:08.900 --> 37:10.660
there is no point making your way here.

527
37:13.240 --> 37:13.920
Right.

528
37:14.740 --> 37:17.740
I have readied all the crucial sacred materials.

529
37:18.200 --> 37:20.620
All that is left is to await the full moon,

530
37:20.640 --> 37:22.100
when we shall perform the ritual.

531
37:27.780 --> 37:28.740
Alright.

532
37:32.820 --> 37:34.060
In the meantime...

533
37:34.360 --> 37:35.640
there is a place

534
37:36.390 --> 37:37.940
I wish you to accompany me to.

535
38:32.930 --> 38:34.130
In my tender years,

536
38:35.060 --> 38:36.660
I took great joy in sitting here at leisure.

537
38:47.550 --> 38:49.230
Can I ask you something?

538
38:50.700 --> 38:51.660
Why...

539
38:52.620 --> 38:54.100
did you become a master?

540
38:56.580 --> 38:58.480
My father before me was a master,

541
38:59.270 --> 39:00.750
a deeply respected one.

542
39:02.160 --> 39:05.100
He inherited the sacred arts from my grandfather.

543
39:07.510 --> 39:08.630
Back then...

544
39:09.080 --> 39:11.080
I was a naive soul.

545
39:11.940 --> 39:14.220
All I knew was that I held him in profound respect,

546
39:15.940 --> 39:18.470
as everyone revered and worshipped him.

547
39:21.860 --> 39:23.580
Though with the passage of time,

548
39:25.140 --> 39:26.910
people developed a dislike for him.

549
39:28.820 --> 39:30.560
They called him deceptive

550
39:30.740 --> 39:31.940
and dogmatic.

551
39:33.510 --> 39:35.290
Some were frightened by him.

552
39:36.860 --> 39:39.230
So, as I matured and became more aware,

553
39:40.270 --> 39:42.660
I did not come to enjoy the state of things.

554
39:44.320 --> 39:46.560
Until I was thirteen or fourteen,

555
39:48.220 --> 39:49.980
I was at death's door.

556
39:50.580 --> 39:52.420
No treatment could fully cure me.

557
39:54.410 --> 39:56.890
The doctor said I was not long for this world.

558
39:57.670 --> 40:00.080
Other children would have died by then.

559
40:01.740 --> 40:04.020
Thus, my father took me to make a vow,

560
40:05.080 --> 40:07.220
praying for the sacred hermit sage's aid.

561
40:10.140 --> 40:12.540
Afterwards, I grew better and better,

562
40:13.030 --> 40:14.590
as if by a miracle.

563
40:20.100 --> 40:21.380
So that's why...

564
40:22.340 --> 40:24.580
you became a master?

565
40:26.020 --> 40:26.700
Not yet.

566
40:27.940 --> 40:29.820
There were times I was skeptical

567
40:32.020 --> 40:33.810
and stubborn, like any child,

568
40:37.060 --> 40:38.840
but after just a sip of liquor,

569
40:38.860 --> 40:40.530
I became ill once again.

570
40:41.730 --> 40:43.410
At that breath, I dared not be stubborn,

571
40:44.740 --> 40:46.980
for it all ran in my blood

572
40:47.640 --> 40:49.160
and through my body.

573
40:50.620 --> 40:52.420
Were I to consider escape,

574
40:54.470 --> 40:56.390
the only thing waiting ahead

575
40:56.870 --> 40:58.350
would be death.

576
41:00.820 --> 41:03.390
Thus, I decided to accept the sacred master's rite.

577
41:08.890 --> 41:10.290
Palms together, bow your head.

578
41:15.570 --> 41:18.910
Metta Gunnang Arahang Metta Namo Buddhaya.

579
41:18.930 --> 41:22.100
Gunnang Arahang Metta Namo Buddhaya.

580
41:23.250 --> 41:26.740
Metta Gunnang Arahang Metta Namo Buddhaya.

581
41:26.770 --> 41:29.250
Namo Buddhaya.

582
41:34.600 --> 41:35.520
We are all done.

583
42:11.220 --> 42:12.140
Have you any notion

584
42:15.060 --> 42:17.360
that I wish for death to finally come to me?

585
42:20.040 --> 42:22.300
But Master bade me live,

586
42:22.590 --> 42:24.830
make merit, and keep the precepts,

587
42:26.780 --> 42:29.680
as my karmic soulmate had already been incarnated.

588
42:30.660 --> 42:32.060
He bade me stay,

589
42:32.080 --> 42:33.480
never to leave,

590
42:34.650 --> 42:36.210
so that when they arrived,

591
42:37.090 --> 42:38.490
our paths would cross.

592
43:11.000 --> 43:14.120
If the person you're waiting for isn't me...

593
43:17.270 --> 43:19.150
you can be honest, my beloved.

594
43:22.530 --> 43:23.360
If...

595
43:23.720 --> 43:26.040
they can be your happiness,

596
43:29.900 --> 43:31.990
I would be happy for you.

597
43:35.190 --> 43:36.830
After all the time we have spent,

598
43:38.440 --> 43:41.060
know you not of my nature?

599
43:47.280 --> 43:49.640
I yearn to feel you till my heart breaks.

600
43:52.250 --> 43:53.450
But it is not the time.

601
43:55.510 --> 43:57.850
Today, we have a much greater aim.

602
44:00.130 --> 44:02.010
Once it is fulfilled,

603
44:02.490 --> 44:04.860
you shall pay me ever so dearly

604
44:12.380 --> 44:14.690
for every ounce of strength I expend.

605
44:21.250 --> 44:22.090
I mean...

606
44:22.890 --> 44:26.010
I just need assurance that

607
44:27.760 --> 44:29.680
you genuinely have feelings for me,

608
44:32.020 --> 44:35.180
not because of what your father told you to believe.

609
44:40.570 --> 44:42.210
Unto my last breath,

610
44:43.610 --> 44:46.140
I long for no one to be by my side but you,

611
44:47.210 --> 44:48.880
and you alone.

612
44:51.350 --> 44:52.330
Therefore,

613
44:52.630 --> 44:55.480
do not dwell too much on my father's words.

614
44:57.550 --> 44:58.570
No way.

615
45:00.930 --> 45:02.340
You can't do that, my beloved.

616
45:03.460 --> 45:04.220
If...

617
45:05.220 --> 45:07.580
something happens to me one day,

618
45:08.560 --> 45:11.570
you need to give yourself a chance, you know that?

619
45:15.520 --> 45:19.110
I don't ever want to see you alone and forlorn again.

620
45:26.110 --> 45:27.530
If one day,

621
45:27.890 --> 45:30.010
death should bereave you of me,

622
45:32.020 --> 45:33.660
do enshrine this...

623
45:36.780 --> 45:38.500
death shall never...

624
45:39.040 --> 45:41.020
bereave me of my love for you.

625
45:41.970 --> 45:42.930
Mm,

626
45:43.490 --> 45:44.290
then...

627
45:45.550 --> 45:47.870
I will take good care of myself

628
45:48.690 --> 45:50.480
and be very mindful,

629
45:50.670 --> 45:51.510
so that...

630
45:52.190 --> 45:55.170
I can live a long, long, long life.

631
45:57.770 --> 45:58.810
As for...

632
46:05.410 --> 46:07.170
all the strength...

633
46:08.070 --> 46:10.530
you expend making the bullets today,

634
46:23.110 --> 46:24.890
I'll make it up to you.

635
46:29.010 --> 46:29.810
With...

636
46:30.810 --> 46:32.490
every ounce of strength I have.

637
46:48.870 --> 46:50.290
Are you actually so touched that you cry?

638
47:03.680 --> 47:13.910
♫At this hour, I shall solemnly solicit♫

639
47:13.930 --> 47:20.180
♫The sacred master to whom I am deeply indebted♫

640
47:20.200 --> 47:26.330
♫To protect and to shield my spirit♫

641
47:26.350 --> 47:35.730
♫With the holy mantra,♫

642
47:36.510 --> 47:44.050
♫Incantation, and sorcery arching over the sky♫

643
47:44.070 --> 47:59.130
♫There dwell ethereal blessings, veiled in protection, to guard the mortal wight♫

644
48:48.940 --> 48:51.220
They are not to be made excessively.

645
48:52.390 --> 48:55.480
Use them only when you must.

646
